{# templates/emails/new_course_notification.html.twig #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nouveau cours disponible sur EduPlay</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #764ba2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .course-details {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
        .course-title {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 22px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .detail-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .detail-icon {
            width: 30px;
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .detail-content {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .detail-value {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .teacher-info {
            background: #e8f4fd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .teacher-avatar {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
        .teacher-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        .teacher-email {
            color: #7f8c8d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .social-links {
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .social-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 10px;
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .pdf-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
        .level-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .level-beginner { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
        .level-intermediate { background: #fff3e0; color: #ef6c00; }
        .level-advanced { background: #ffebee; color: #c62828; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .detail-item { flex-direction: column; }
            .detail-icon { margin-bottom: 5px; }
            .teacher-info { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
            .teacher-avatar { margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🎉 Nouveau cours disponible !</h1>
        <p>{{ teacher.firstName }} {{ teacher.lastName }} a créé un nouveau cours</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
            Bonjour {{ parent.firstName }} {{ parent.lastName }},
        </div>

        <p>Nous sommes ravis de vous annoncer l'ajout d'un nouveau cours passionnant sur <strong>EduPlay</strong> ! Découvrez-le dès maintenant :</p>

        <div class="course-details">
            <h2 class="course-title">{{ course.title }}</h2>

            <div class="detail-item">
                <span class="detail-icon">📝</span>
                <div class="detail-content">
                    <span class="detail-label">Description</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{ course.description }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-item">
                <span class="detail-icon">📊</span>
                <div class="detail-content">
                    <span class="detail-label">Niveau</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">
                            <span class="level-badge level-
                                {% if course.level == 'Beginner' %}beginner
                                {% elseif course.level == 'Intermediate' %}intermediate
                                {% else %}advanced
                                {% endif %}">
                                {% if course.level == 'Beginner' %}Débutant
                                {% elseif course.level == 'Intermediate' %}Intermédiaire
                                {% else %}Avancé
                                {% endif %}
                            </span>
                        </span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-item">
                <span class="detail-icon">⏱️</span>
                <div class="detail-content">
                    <span class="detail-label">Durée</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{ course.durationTraining }} semaines</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            {% if course.pdfFile %}
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-icon">📎</span>
                    <div class="detail-content">
                        <span class="detail-label">Support de cours</span>
                        <span class="detail-value">
                            PDF disponible
                            <span class="pdf-badge">✓ Inclus</span>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="teacher-info">
                <div class="teacher-avatar">
                    {{ teacher.firstName|first }}{{ teacher.lastName|first }}
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="teacher-name">{{ teacher.firstName }} {{ teacher.lastName }}</div>
                    <div class="teacher-email">{{ teacher.email }}</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #666;">Votre professeur</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p style="font-style: italic; color: #666;">
            ⏳ Ce cours est en attente de validation par notre équipe. Vous recevrez une notification dès qu'il sera disponible pour inscription.
        </p>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ course_url }}" class="button">
                Voir tous les cours
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div class="social-links">
            <a href="#" class="social-link">Facebook</a>
            <a href="#" class="social-link">Twitter</a>
            <a href="#" class="social-link">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
        <p>© {{ year }} EduPlay. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 15px;">
            <a href="#" style="color: #667eea;">Se désabonner</a> •
            <a href="#" style="color: #667eea;">Politique de confidentialité</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>